  <section xml:id="universal-quantifier">
    <title>Universal Quantifier</title>
    <informaltable frame="none">
      <tgroup cols="2">
        <colspec colname="c1" align="center"/>
        <colspec colname="c2" align="center"/>
        <tbody>
          <row>
            <entry rowsep="1"><mathphrase>&#x0393;, A[t/x] &#x22A2; &#x0394;</mathphrase></entry>
            <entry rowsep="1"><mathphrase>&#x0393; &#x22A2; &#x0394;, A[y/x]</mathphrase></entry>
          </row>
          <row>
            <entry><mathphrase>&#x0393;, &#x2200; x.A &#x22A2; &#x0394; (&#x2200;L)</mathphrase></entry>
            <entry><mathphrase>&#x0393; &#x22A2; &#x0394;, &#x2200; x.A (&#x2200;R)</mathphrase></entry>
          </row>
        </tbody>
      </tgroup>
    </informaltable>
    <para>
      In <mathphrase>(&#x2200;L)</mathphrase>, <mathphrase>t</mathphrase> must be free for <mathphrase>x</mathphrase> in <mathphrase>A</mathphrase>.
      In <mathphrase>(&#x2200;R)</mathphrase>, <mathphrase>y</mathphrase> is an <emphasis>eigenvariable</emphasis>, not free in the conclusion.
    </para>
  </section>

  <section xml:id="existential-quantifier">
    <title>Existential Quantifier</title>
    <informaltable frame="none">
      <tgroup cols="2">
        <colspec colname="c1" align="center"/>
        <colspec colname="c2" align="center"/>
        <tbody>
          <row>
            <entry rowsep="1"><mathphrase>&#x0393;, A[y/x] &#x22A2; &#x0394;</mathphrase></entry>
            <entry rowsep="1"><mathphrase>&#x0393; &#x22A2; &#x0394;, A[t/x]</mathphrase></entry>
          </row>
          <row>
            <entry><mathphrase>&#x0393;, &#x2203; x.A &#x22A2; &#x0394; (&#x2203;L)</mathphrase></entry>
            <entry><mathphrase>&#x0393; &#x22A2; &#x0394;, &#x2203; x.A (&#x2203;R)</mathphrase></entry>
          </row>
        </tbody>
      </tgroup>
    </informaltable>
    <para>
      In <mathphrase>(&#x2203;L)</mathphrase>, <mathphrase>y</mathphrase> is an <emphasis>eigenvariable</emphasis>, not free in the conclusion.
      In <mathphrase>(&#x2203;R)</mathphrase>, <mathphrase>t</mathphrase> must be free for <mathphrase>x</mathphrase> in <mathphrase>A</mathphrase>.
    </para>
  </section>

</section>
